    "preamble": "Nagnath Appasaheb Chivadshetti vs The State Of Maharashtra on 30 October, 2018 Author: Mridula Bhatkar Bench: Mridula Bhatkar Sherla V. revn.584.20 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Criminal Revision Application No.584 Of 2018 Nagnath Appasaheb Chivadshetti ... Ap Vs. The State of Maharashtra ... Respond Mr.Ritesh Thobde for the Applicant Ms.Rutuja Ambekar, App, for the Respondent - State Coram: Mrs.MRIDULA Bhatkar, J. Dated: October 30, 2018 P.C.: 1. 2. The applicant/accused is convicted for the offences under sections 7(1) r/w section 2(ia)(a) punishable under section 16 of Nagnath Appasaheb Chivadshetti vs The State Of Maharashtra on 30 October, 2018 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/192043932/ 1 the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954 and is sentenced to Page 1 of 3 ::: Uploaded on - 30/10/2018 ::: Downloaded on - 02/ revn.584.2018_909.doc",
    "facts": "",
